@startuml

participant "LevelManager" as LevelManager
participant "PerspectiveManager" as PerspectiveManager
participant "Concrete Asymmetry Components" as Asymmetry

== Awake ==

LevelManager -> LevelManager: Fetch PerspectiveManager\nand NetworkManager
PerspectiveManager -> PerspectiveManager: Query scene for\nBaseAsymProperty instances

== Start ==

LevelManager -> LevelManager: Determine local player role
LevelManager -> PerspectiveManager: Apply local perspective
PerspectiveManager -> Asymmetry: Configure role-specific state

@enduml